<body><div class="lf-page"><div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 41 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Perimeter概念＋公式</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">封閉圖形一周的長度 · SquareRectanglePerimeter公式 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info"><b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》3下B冊<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span> Perimeter係呈分試幾何題基礎，P4 Area必用<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>長度單位（cm·m）· SquareRectangle認識 · Addition<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 理解「Perimeter = 繞圖形一周的長度」 ❷ SquarePerimeter公式 ❸ RectanglePerimeter公式<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T10 Perimeter vs Area混淆 · T11 Rectangle漏 ×2 · T12 唔記得加返所有邊</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row"><span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span></div>
</div><div><div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>用間尺度課本封面的四邊，加埋一齊就係咩？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Square有幾多條邊？每條邊長度有咩關係？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Rectangle有幾多條邊？邊條同邊條一樣長？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>用軟尺度一個Circle形杯蓋嘅邊緣一周，呢個長度叫咩？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個Square邊長 5cm，佢嘅Perimeter係？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Perimeter概念 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <b>Perimeter（Perimeter）</b>= 繞着封閉圖形一周的總長度<br/>②「封閉」= 頭尾相連，冇開口<br/>③ Perimeter嘅單位同長度一樣：cm、m<br/>④ 例：用軟尺度Square一周 = 20cm → Perimeter = 20cm<br/>⑤ <b>關鍵：</b>Perimeter係「圍一圈」嘅長度，唔係「入面」嘅Area！</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：SquarePerimeter公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <div style="text-align:center;margin:10px 0;"><svg style="max-width:230px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 230 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="150" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="150" x="20" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="90.0" x2="100.0" y1="12" y2="12"></line>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="90.0" x2="100.0" y1="188" y2="188"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="170" y1="35" y2="35"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="170" x2="170" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="95.0" y="49">6 cm</text>
</svg></div>
Square 4 條邊一樣長<br/>② 公式：<b>Perimeter = 邊長 × 4</b><br/>③ 例：邊長 6cm → Perimeter = 6×4 = 24cm<br/>④ 反推：Perimeter ÷ 4 = 邊長（考試必考逆向題！）<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「Square，四邊等，邊長 ×4 就係Perimeter！」</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：RectanglePerimeter公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <div style="text-align:center;margin:10px 0;"><svg style="max-width:330px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 330 170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="100" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="250" x="20" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="270" y1="35" y2="35"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="270" x2="270" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="145.0" y="49">10 cm</text>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="288" x2="288" y1="20" y2="120"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="283" x2="293" y1="20" y2="20"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="283" x2="293" y1="120" y2="120"></line>
</svg></div>
Rectangle有長（length）和闊（width）<br/>② 兩條長一樣，兩條闊一樣<br/>③ 公式：<b>Perimeter =（長 + 闊）× 2</b><br/>④ 例：長 8cm、闊 3cm →（8+3）×2 = 22cm<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「Rectangle，長加闊，乘 2 之后就係Perimeter！」</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一個Square花圃邊長 7m。用鐵絲圍一圈要幾長？</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Rectangle畫板長 12cm、闊 8cm。Perimeter係幾多？</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一個SquarePerimeter係 36cm，邊長係幾多？</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>Square邊長 5cm，Perimeter = 5+5 = 10cm？<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b>Square有四條邊！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Square邊長 5cm<br/>Perimeter = 5×4 = 20cm ✓<br/>4 條邊都要計！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>Rectangle長 6cm、闊 4cm<br/>Perimeter = 6+4 = 10cm？<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b>唔記得 ×2！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Rectangle長 6cm、闊 4cm<br/>Perimeter = (6+4)×2 = 20cm ✓<br/>長加闊之後要乘 2！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>一個不規則五邊形，用尺<br/>逐條邊量：3+5+4+6+4=22？<br/><b>✅ 啱！</b>Perimeter就係加晒所有邊！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Perimeter = 加晒所有邊的總和<br/>規則形狀用公式<br/>不規則形狀就逐條邊加！</div></div><div class="warn">⚠️ Perimeter係「圍一圈」，Area係「入面大細」。唔好撈亂！考試成日將兩者放同一題考你。</div><div class="warn">⚠️ Rectangle公式 (長+闊)×2，入面嘅括號唔可以漏！先加後乘。</div><div class="warn">⚠️ TrianglePerimeter都係三條邊相加。任何封閉圖形一周總長 = Perimeter，唔理形狀規則唔規則。</div></div><div><div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div><div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 6 題） Foundation Tier（All Must Complete）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>Square邊長 4cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>Rectangle長 7cm、闊 2cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>Square邊長 9cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>Rectangle長 5cm、闊 5cm，呢個係咩形狀？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一個Triangle三條邊分別係 3cm、4cm、5cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>SquarePerimeter 40cm，邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 5 題） Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 30cm，長 10cm，闊 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>一塊Rectangle地毯長 3m、闊 2m。周邊要縫花邊，花邊要幾長？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>兩個Square邊長分別 5cm 和 3cm，拼成一個Rectangle。新Perimeter = ？（提示：唔係兩者相加！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>一個SquarePerimeter 48cm，邊長係？如果邊長增加 2cm，新Perimeter係？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>Rectangle長 12cm、闊係長嘅一半。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 5 題） Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 100cm，長比闊多 10cm。長和闊各係幾多？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一個Rectangle被分成兩個Square，每個SquarePerimeter 24cm。原RectanglePerimeter係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>兩個相同Rectangle拼成一個大Square。Rectangle長 8cm，大SquarePerimeter係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>長 20m、闊 12m 嘅地面，用邊長 50cm 嘅地磚鋪邊界，需要幾多塊？（提示：單位要統一！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>RectanglePerimeter同SquarePerimeter一樣。Rectangle長 14cm、闊 10cm。Square邊長係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🏔️ Extreme Tier（共 2 題） </div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>一個 L 形圖形由兩個Rectangle拼成（6×4 和 4×2），重疊部分為 2×2。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>一條 200m 嘅繩剛好圍一個Square花圃兩圈。花圃邊長係？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題，共 {len(word_probs)} 題）</div>{qt_table(word_probs)}</div><div><div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div><div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 9 題）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>Square邊長 8cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Rectangle長 9cm、闊 4cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>Triangle三邊 6cm、8cm、10cm，Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>SquarePerimeter 60cm，邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 44cm，長 14cm，闊 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>Square邊長 12cm，Perimeter同Area一樣大嗎？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個SquarePerimeter 32cm。邊長增加 3cm 後，新Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>Rectangle長 15cm、闊係長嘅 1/3。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>兩個Rectangle（長 10cm、闊 4cm）拼成新圖形，Perimeter最細可以係？（提示：重疊最長嘅邊）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 5 題 🚀）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H10</td><td>SquarePerimeter 28cm。用 4 個咁嘅Square拼成一個大Square，大SquarePerimeter係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H11</td><td>一條鐵絲 60cm 長，剛好圍成一個Rectangle。長係闊嘅 2 倍，長闊各係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H12</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 80cm，長 25cm。如果長減少 5cm，闊要增加幾多先令Perimeter不變？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H13</td><td>一個 L 形圖形Perimeter：兩個Rectangle（5×3 和 4×2）拼成 L 形。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H14</td><td>用一條固定長度嘅繩圍出一個Rectangle。長=闊（即Square）時，Perimeter有咩變化？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div><div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
