<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div></div>
<table class="et"><tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td><b>Perimeter vs Area概念混淆</b></td><td>Perimeter係圍一圈嘅長度（邊界），Area係入面嘅大細（內部）。記住：Perimeter用長度單位 cm/m，Area用平方單位 cm²/m²。</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><b>Rectangle公式漏乘 2</b></td><td>Perimeter = 長+闊+長+闊 = (長+闊)×2。成日有人寫 長+闊 就停咗！</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><b>唔記得Square四邊相等</b></td><td>Square四邊一樣長，所以Perimeter = 邊長×4。唔好逐條邊加！</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><b>計咗部分邊唔係全部邊</b></td><td>Perimeter一定要計齊所有邊！每個凸出嘅邊都要計，唔可以漏。</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><b>逆向題唔識做</b></td><td>俾Perimeter求邊長：Square邊長 = Perimeter÷4；Rectangle長 = Perimeter÷2−闊。</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><b>單位混亂</b></td><td>長度和Perimeter用 cm/m。留意Question單位係 cm 定 m，唔好混用！</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><b>拼砌圖形重複計邊</b></td><td>兩個圖形拼埋一齊，重疊嘅邊唔計入新Perimeter。拼得越多，慳嘅邊越多！</td></tr></table><div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「Square四邊等，邊長×4就係Perimeter！Rectangle長加闊，乘2之后就係Perimeter！Perimeter係圍一圈，唔係入面嘅Area！積分邊界要分清！」</div><div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div><div class="sc"><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">搵Perimeter</div><div class="sdetail">確認圖形封閉，逐條邊度長度</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">選公式</div><div class="sdetail">規則形狀用公式，不規則形狀逐邊加</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">代入計算</div><div class="sdetail">小心單位，齊晒所有邊先寫答案</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">覆檢</div><div class="sdetail">逆推：Perimeter÷4=邊長（Square）；(長+闊)×2=Perimeter（Rectangle）</div></div></div>
